  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Add AI-assisted editing foundations: change sets, content revisions and proposal review by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/183\n* Follow-ups to AI-assisted editing: Java id parity, lockfile, ghost sizes and tests by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/184\n* Add host context actions to the workflow editor by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/186\n* Add a live Action Type catalog to the workflow editor by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/187\n* Add an AI Assisted Editor tab to the demo app by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/189\n* Bump development version to 3.0.0-SNAPSHOT by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/190\n* Update dependency @playwright/test to v1.64.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/178\n* Update dependency vite to v8.3.4 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/181\n* Update dependency python to v3.15.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/188\n* Update actions/setup-node digest to 949feb2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/179\n* Let hosts auto-tidy the layout of applied AI changes by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/191\n* Update dependency @types/node to v26.6.5 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/185\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v2.7.1...v3.0.0",
